OL,3,GNEWSAInquest into death of Lucy Letby's
OL,4,A'boyfriend' opens
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is reason to suspect the death of
OL,7,Fa man labelled in court as the
OL,8,F"boyfriend" of serial killer Lucy Letby
OL,9,Fwas "unnatural", the opening of an
OL,10,Finquest has heard.
OL,12,FDr Mark Deakin, 53, from Winsford,
OL,13,FCheshire, was found collapsed in his
OL,14,Fcar on 24 June and was rushed to
OL,15,Fhospital where he died nine days later.
OL,17,FDeakin worked alongside Letby, now 36,
OL,18,Fat the Countess of Chester Hospital
OL,19,Fduring the period in which she murdered
OL,20,Fseven babies and attempted to murder
OL,21,Fseven others in 2015 and 2016.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
